{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0002.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0002", "text": "‘I will not live there again, until it belongs to me,’ his father had said.", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0005.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c1_0005", "text": "‘You must not be afraid,’ his father said, nervously, ‘he is a very old man, now, very ill.’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0006.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0006", "text": "‘I am never afraid.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0013.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c1_0013", "text": "‘Ah, well,’ Mr Hooper had said, and coughed, ‘he is very ill. You know. But I am glad you have seen him.’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0014.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c1_0014", "text": "‘Why?’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0015.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c1_0015", "text": "‘Well – because you are his only grandson. His heir, I suppose. Yes. It is only as it should be.’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0020.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c1_0020", "text": "‘All he looks like,’ Edmund Hooper said, ‘is one of his dead old moths.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0021.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c1_0021", "text": "‘That is not the way to speak! You must show respect.’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0027.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0027", "text": "He said, ‘I shall be away in London a good deal. I cannot live here the whole time, even in your holidays.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0028.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c1_0028", "text": "‘That won’t be anything new, will it?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0031.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0031", "text": "‘Ah, but we shall be looking into things,’ he said, ‘I shall see about getting you a friend, as well as someone to look after us in this house. Something is soon to be done.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0033.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0033", "text": "‘You had better not go into the Red Room without asking me. I shall keep the key in here.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0034.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c1_0034", "text": "‘I wouldn’t do any harm, there, why can’t I go?’", "voice": "Thomas_begging_3", "voice_was": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0035.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c1_0035", "text": "‘Well –there are a good many valuable things. That is all. Really.’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0037.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0037", "text": "‘And I cannot think that it will be a room to interest you much.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0042.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0042", "text": "‘Can I have the key now, then?’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0043.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c1_0043", "text": "‘May...’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0044.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0044", "text": "‘O.K.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0045.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0045", "text": "‘The key for the Red Room?’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0046.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0046", "text": "‘Yes.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0047.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c1_0047", "text": "‘Well...’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0049.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c1_0049", "text": "But then, said, ‘No. No, you had really much better be playing cricket in the sun, Edmund, something of that sort. You have been shown everything there is in the Red Room.’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0050.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c1_0050", "text": "‘There’s nobody to play cricket with.’", "voice": "Thomas_wronged_1", "voice_was": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0051.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0051", "text": "‘Ah, well now, I shall soon be doing something about that, you shall have your friend.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0052.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c1_0052", "text": "‘Anyway, I don’t like cricket.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0053.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c1_0053", "text": "‘Edmund, you will not be difficult, please, I have a good deal to do, I cannot waste time in foolish arguments.’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0070.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0070", "text": "‘I am not ashamed of it,’ he had told his friends in the City.", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0076.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0076", "text": "‘That is the history of Warings,’ the present Joseph Hooper had told his son, Edmund, taking him solemnly around.", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0077.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0077", "text": "‘You should be very proud.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0105.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0105", "text": "His father had said, ‘But look at all the others, so much larger and brighter. You had better take the old playroom and have that to yourself.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0140.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0140", "text": "‘Your grandfather was one of the most important collectors of his day,’ Joseph Hooper had said, showing the boy round.", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0141.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0141", "text": "‘He was known and respected the world over. This collection is worth a great deal of money.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0146.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0146", "text": "‘This will all belong to you,’ his father had said, ‘you must learn the value of what you are to inherit.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0149.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c1_0149", "text": "‘It’s easy for you to despise and shrug your shoulders,’ his father had said, seeing it was.", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0150.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c1_0150", "text": "‘You pay no attention to what a man has done. I am an international authority, but you think nothing of that. Well, let me see you make a name for yourself, in some way or other.’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0153.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0153", "text": "‘It is a splendid thing for a man to become world famous in that way,’ he said.", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0154.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0154", "text": "‘Throughout his life, your grandfather devoted all of his free time", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0158.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0158", "text": "‘I have seen you catching butterflies in jam jars and so on,’ Joseph Hooper said, ‘I daresay that is a sign of interest, I daresay that you will follow in his footsteps more than I ever did.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0159.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0159", "text": "‘The butterflies were just a craze last term. We caught larvae and watched them hatch. Nobody’s interested now.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0162.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c1_0162", "text": "‘Why didn’t you bring me here before?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0163.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c1_0163", "text": "‘You came – you were brought here as a baby.’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0164.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c1_0164", "text": "‘That’s years ago.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0165.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c1_0165", "text": "‘Well – yes.’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0166.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c1_0166", "text": "‘I suppose you quarrelled with grandfather then.’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0167.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0167", "text": "Joseph Hooper sighed. ‘That is not the sort of thing to way, it is not something we need to be concerned with now.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c1_0187.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c1_0187", "text": "‘Death’s Head Hawk Moth.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0190.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0190", "text": "‘Some people are coming here today,’ said Joseph Hooper, ‘now you will have a companion.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0194.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0194", "text": "‘Perhaps you might agree to come for the summer, just at first,’ he had written, ‘to see how you and your boy settle, and how we all of us rub along.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0195.wav", "who": "Helena", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c2_0195", "text": "‘Warings,’ Mrs Helena Kingshaw had replied, ‘sounds so much like the home we have been looking for.’", "voice": "Helena_excited_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0198.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0198", "text": "‘I am a lonely man,’ he had said, and was not ashamed, afterwards, of having admitted it.", "voice": "Joseph_wronged_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0199.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0199", "text": "‘His name is Charles Kingshaw, and he is just your age, he is almost eleven. You must make a good effort to welcome him and be friendly.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0210.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0210", "text": "‘I’m quite all right. There isn’t anything wrong at all.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0212.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0212", "text": "‘There’s nothing wrong.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0217.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0217", "text": "‘It is my house,’ he thought, ‘it is private, I got here first. Nobody should come here.’", "voice": "Thomas_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0230.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0230", "text": "‘Edmund! Now your friend is here, I wish you would not lurk about the place, it is so very ill-mannered. Come out here, please. Edmund!’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0234.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0234", "text": "‘Edmund, you will come down here at once!’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0240.wav", "who": "Helena", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0240", "text": "‘Come along, Charles dear, you must help me with the cases, we cannot leave everything to Mr Hooper.’", "voice": "Helena_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0242.wav", "who": "Helena", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0242", "text": "‘Oh – what is it, what have you found?’", "voice": "Helena_nervous_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0246.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0246", "text": "‘Nothing, it’s nothing. It’s only a pebble.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0248.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0248", "text": "‘I DIDN’T WANT YOU TO COME HERE’ was written.", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0249.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0249", "text": "‘Now let me show you to your rooms,’ said Mr Joseph Hooper.", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0251.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0251", "text": "Hooper said ‘Why have you come here?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0257.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0257", "text": "‘Why did you have to find somewhere new to live?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0262.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0262", "text": "‘Scaredy!’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0263.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0263", "text": "‘No.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0264.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c2_0264", "text": "‘When my father dies,’ Hooper said, ‘this house will belong to me, I shall be master. It’ll all be mine.’", "voice": "Thomas_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0265.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0265", "text": "‘That’s nothing. It’s only an old house.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2", "voice_was": "Charles_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0267.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0267", "text": "He said quietly, ‘Downstairs is something very valuable. Something you’ve never seen.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0268.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0268", "text": "‘What then?’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0271.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0271", "text": "‘My grandfather died in this room. Not very long ago, either. He lay and died in that bed. Now it’s your bed.’", "voice": "Thomas_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0274.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0274", "text": "‘Where did you live before?’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0275.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0275", "text": "‘In a flat.’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0276.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0276", "text": "‘Where?’", "voice": "Thomas_scold_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0277.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0277", "text": "‘London.’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0278.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0278", "text": "‘Your own flat?’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0279.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0279", "text": "‘Yes – no. Well, it was in somebody’s house.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0280.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0280", "text": "‘You were only tenants, then.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0281.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0281", "text": "‘Yes.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0282.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0282", "text": "‘It wasn’t really yours.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0283.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0283", "text": "‘No.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0284.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0284", "text": "‘Why didn’t your father buy a proper house?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0291.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0291", "text": "‘Well, my mother can’t afford to buy us a house, can she? We can’t help that.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0292.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0292", "text": "‘Your father should have left you some money, then, shouldn’t he? Didn’t he have a house.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0293.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0293", "text": "‘Yes, he did, but it had to be sold.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0294.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0294", "text": "‘Why?’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0295.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0295", "text": "‘I don’t know.’", "voice": "Charles_excited_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0296.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0296", "text": "‘To pay off all his debts.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0297.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0297", "text": "‘No, no.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0298.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0298", "text": "‘Do you remember your father?’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0299.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0299", "text": "‘Oh, yes. Well – a bit. He was a pilot, once. He was in the Battle of Britain. I’ve got...’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0301.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0301", "text": "‘...I’ve got a picture of him.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0302.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0302", "text": "‘Is it a picture of him in the Battle?’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0303.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0303", "text": "‘No. But...’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0304.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0304", "text": "‘I don’t believe you, anyway, you’re a liar, the Battle of Britain was in the war.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0305.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0305", "text": "‘Well, I know that, everybody knows that.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0306.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0306", "text": "‘It was years ago, dozens of years. It was history. He couldn’t have been in it.’", "voice": "Thomas_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0307.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0307", "text": "‘He was, he was’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0308.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0308", "text": "‘When did he die, then?’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0309.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0309", "text": "‘Here’s the picture, look – that’s my father.’", "voice": "Charles_wronged_1", "voice_was": "Charles_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0310.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0310", "text": "‘When did he die, I said.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0312.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0312", "text": "‘A few years ago. I was about five. Or six.’", "voice": "Charles_wronged_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1", "emo_was": "紧张"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0313.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0313", "text": "‘He would have been pretty old by then. How old was he?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0314.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0314", "text": "‘I don’t know. Quite old, I suppose. Look, then, there’s the photograph.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0320.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0320", "text": "‘He’s old,’ He said.", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0321.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0321", "text": "‘I told you. When he was in the Battle of Britain, he was twenty. That was the war.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0324.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0324", "text": "‘Where do you go to school?’", "voice": "Thomas_scold_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0325.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0325", "text": "‘In Wales.’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0326.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0326", "text": "Hooper raised his eyebrows, ‘I should think there would be about a hundred schools in Wales. More than a hundred.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0327.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0327", "text": "‘It’s called St Vincent’s.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0328.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0328", "text": "‘Is it a proper school?’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0340.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0340", "text": "‘You’d better shut the window,’ Kingshaw said, ‘it’s my window now.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0356.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0356", "text": "‘I’m supposed to, that’s what your father said.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0357.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0357", "text": "‘You do what I say.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0358.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0358", "text": "‘Don’t be stupid.’", "voice": "Charles_excited_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0359.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0359", "text": "‘I’ll bash you again, just watch it.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0365.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0365", "text": "‘Is your school a proper boarding school?’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0366.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0366", "text": "‘Yes.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0367.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0367", "text": "‘Well how does your mother afford to pay for you at a boarding school if she can’t afford for you to live in a house?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0368.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0368", "text": "‘I think... I don’t know. I think it’s free.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0369.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0369", "text": "‘No schools are free.’", "voice": "Thomas_defiant_1", "voice_note": "2026-11-15 19:2x 纠正：原 Thomas_begging_1 生成出 0.26s 残片（4 词），换 defiant 参考重生成"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0370.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0370", "text": "‘Yes, they are.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0371.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0371", "text": "‘Only schools for poor people. Boarding schools aren’t free.’", "voice": "Thomas_defiant_1", "voice_note": "2026-11-15 16:5x 纠正：激动反抗原挂 Thomas_calm_1（档内 14/19 是平静），改挂原生 defiant 档；换参考后声纹 med 0.237→0.639"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0372.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0372", "text": "‘It’s... I don’t know. I daresay my father paid them a lot of money when I first went there. I daresay he paid all of the fees at once,", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0393.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0393", "text": "‘You still needn’t think you’re wanted here,’ he said, ‘this isn’t your place.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0404.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0404", "text": "‘It is my window, now.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2", "voice_was": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0409.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0409", "text": "‘Edmund, why have you locked yourself in here? You will please open the door.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0411.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0411", "text": "‘I am quite sure that you are in there, you need not pretend.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0413.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0413", "text": "‘Edmund!’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0415.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0415", "text": "‘What are you doing, locked away here? It does not seem to me a very normal way to behave. You should be outside, getting plenty of fresh air, you should be showing Charles Kingshaw about the village.’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0419.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0419", "text": "‘But that is not what any battlefield ever was, that...’", "voice": "Joseph_nervous_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0426.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0426", "text": "‘Where is Charles Kingshaw?’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0427.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0427", "text": "‘He might be anywhere. I don’t know where.’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0428.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0428", "text": "‘Then you should know, Edmund, you should be with him. I am not very pleased by this way you are behaving. Why are you not with him?’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0429.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0429", "text": "‘Because I don’t know where he is.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0430.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0430", "text": "‘Do not answer me back, please.’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1", "voice_note": "2026-11-15 17:2x 纠正：激动反抗原挂 Joseph_normal_1（同情绪另 9 条都用 defiant 档）"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0435.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0435", "text": "‘Well you had better look for him, and then take him around the place, show him the house and the village and so on, make him feel", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0437.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c2_0437", "text": "‘Oh. Are they going to stay, then?’", "voice": "Thomas_nervous_1", "voice_was": "Thomas_begging_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0438.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0438", "text": "‘They will stay for the summer, certainly. And I am quite sure...’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0443.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0443", "text": "‘I want you to get on with Charles, and with Mrs Kingshaw, too. There will be days when I shall not come back until very late, nights when I have to stay up in London altogether. You will...’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0444.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0444", "text": "‘What?’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0445.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0445", "text": "‘Well – the Kingshaws are here, everything is for the best. You will have company.’", "voice": "Joseph_normal_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0447.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0447", "text": "‘Edmund, you are behaving in a very uncivil way towards a visitor.’", "voice": "Joseph_defiant_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0448.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0448", "text": "‘I thought you said this was his home. If it’s his home, then he can’t be a visitor, can he?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0461.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0461", "text": "‘You’ve got to come with me now.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0462.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0462", "text": "‘Where to?’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0463.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c2_0463", "text": "‘You’ll see.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0466.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0466", "text": "‘Come on.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0467.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0467", "text": "‘Suppose I don’t want to.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0468.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0468", "text": "‘You’ve got to, that’s all, my father said so. And if anyone catches you bashing those flowers there’ll be trouble, as well.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0469.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0469", "text": "‘I haven’t bashed them.’", "voice": "Charles_excited_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0470.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0470", "text": "‘Yes, you have, some petals have fallen on to the floor, look here.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0471.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c2_0471", "text": "‘They do fall. They fall on their own.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0480.wav", "who": "Helena", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c2_0480", "text": "‘So you are both going on a tour of the estate!’", "voice": "Helena_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0486.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0486", "text": "‘You needn’t think I want to take you anywhere. I shall run now, you’d just better keep up with me.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0487.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c2_0487", "text": "‘What are you going back into the house for? I’ve seen all the house, haven’t I?’", "voice": "Charles_wary_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0488.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0488", "text": "‘My father said to show you everywhere, and don’t I always do what my father says?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0491.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c2_0491", "text": "‘This is my father’s room, this is my spare room, this is where trunks are kept, this is your mother’s sitting room, now we go up the back staircase, this is a bathroom, this is a cupboard, this is another bathroom...’", "voice": "Thomas_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0501.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0501", "text": "‘You were told to follow me.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0502.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0502", "text": "‘So what? I don’t have to take orders from you.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0503.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0503", "text": "‘I’m showing you around!’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c2_0505.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c2_0505", "text": "‘You’re just a fool, that’s a stupid way to behave.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0622.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0622", "text": "‘You were scared. You were running away.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0623.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0623", "text": "‘This is my room, you can’t come in here just when you want, Hooper.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0624.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0624", "text": "‘You should lock the door, then, shouldn’t you?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0625.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0625", "text": "‘There isn’t any key.’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0626.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0626", "text": "‘Scared of a bird!’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0627.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c3_0627", "text": "‘I was not, then.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0628.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0628", "text": "‘You were crying, I know, I can tell.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0629.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0629", "text": "‘Shut up, shut up.’", "voice": "Charles_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0630.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0630", "text": "‘It was only a crow, a crow isn’t anything, haven’t you ever seen a crow before? What did you think it would do?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0631.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0631", "text": "‘It...’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0632.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c3_0632", "text": "‘What? What did it do?’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0634.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0634", "text": "‘Was it a naughty crow, then, did it frighten Mummy’s baby-boy?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0637.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c3_0637", "text": "‘Why did you go off, anyway? Where did you think you’d get to?’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_3"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0638.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0638", "text": "‘Mind your own business. I don’t have to tell you anything.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0639.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0639", "text": "‘Shall I tell you something, Kingshaw?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0643.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0643", "text": "‘I’ll tell you something, babybaby, you daren’t go into the copse.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0645.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0645", "text": "‘You went and looked and stopped, because you were a scaredy, it’s dark in there.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0646.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c3_0646", "text": "‘I changed my mind, that’s all.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0648.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0648", "text": "‘All right,’ he said, in a menacing, amiable voice, ‘O.K., go in there, I dare you. And I’ll watch. Or into the big wood, even. Yes, you daren’t go up into the big wood. If you do, it’ll be O.K.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0649.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c3_0649", "text": "‘What will?’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0650.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0650", "text": "‘Things.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0651.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0651", "text": "‘I’m not afraid of you, Hooper.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0652.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0652", "text": "‘Liar.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0653.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0653", "text": "‘I can go into the wood any time I want.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0654.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0654", "text": "‘Liar.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0655.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0655", "text": "‘I don’t care if you believe me or not.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_2", "voice_was": "Charles_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0656.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0656", "text": "‘Oh, yes you do. Liar, liar, liar.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0659.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0659", "text": "‘I dare you to go into the copse.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0660.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0660", "text": "‘Oh, stuff it.’", "voice": "Charles_angry_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0670.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0670", "text": "‘Stare you out,’ he said coolly.", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0796.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0796", "text": "‘It’s O.K.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0797.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0797", "text": "Hooper said, ‘you can keep it if you like.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0802.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c3_0802", "text": "‘Well, it is so nice to see them shaking down together, after all,’ said Mr Joseph Hooper to Mrs Kingshaw, a little later, after the boys had left the room.", "voice": "Joseph_excited_2"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0803.wav", "who": "Joseph", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c3_0803", "text": "‘I think they may be friends.’", "voice": "Joseph_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0809.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0809", "text": "‘What are you prying at?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0811.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0811", "text": "‘You can’t get in there, it’s locked. It’s the Red Room and it’s private. My father keeps the key.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0812.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0812", "text": "‘What for? It’s only a lot of old books and dead fish.’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0813.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0813", "text": "‘That’s all you know.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0814.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c3_0814", "text": "‘What then?’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0815.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0815", "text": "‘Valuable things, I told you that before. Things you’ll never ever have seen.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0819.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0819", "text": "‘Want me to show you?’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0822.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0822", "text": "‘You can come with me after supper,’ Hooper said.", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0826.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c3_0826", "text": "‘I’ve got the key now,’ Hooper said, coming up behind him.", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0834.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0834", "text": "‘Go on then,’ he said in a soft voice, ‘you’ve got to look now. You should just think yourself lucky I’ve brought you. Go on.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0837.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0837", "text": "‘Moths.’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0838.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c3_0838", "text": "‘Yes, every sort of moth in the world.’", "voice": "Thomas_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0839.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0839", "text": "‘Who... where did they come from?’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0840.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0840", "text": "‘My grandfather. Haven’t you ever heard of him? You’re thick aren’t you? My grandfather was the most famous collector in the whole world. He wrote all sorts of books about moths.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0848.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0848", "text": "‘Open one of the cases, then,’ he said.", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0849.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0849", "text": "‘I’ll let you.’", "voice": "Thomas_calm_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0851.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0851", "text": "‘No.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0852.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0852", "text": "‘Why not?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0853.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0853", "text": "‘I – I can see them all right, can’t I?’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0854.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0854", "text": "‘Yes, but you can’t touch them, can you. You’ve got to touch them.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0855.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0855", "text": "‘No.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0856.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0856", "text": "‘Why not? Scaredy-baby, scared of a moth!’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0858.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0858", "text": "‘Pick one up.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0860.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0860", "text": "‘What’s the matter, baby?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0861.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0861", "text": "‘Nothing. I don’t want to touch one, that’s all.’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0862.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "平静", "id": "c3_0862", "text": "‘They won’t hurt you.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0863.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0863", "text": "‘No.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0864.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0864", "text": "‘They’re dead, aren’t they? They’ve been dead for years and years.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0865.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0865", "text": "‘Yes.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0866.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0866", "text": "‘What are you scared of? Are you scared of dead things?’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0867.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0867", "text": "‘No.’", "voice": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0871.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0871", "text": "‘Come here and look, Kingshaw.’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0872.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0872", "text": "‘I don’t want to.’", "voice": "Charles_excited_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0873.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "激动反抗", "id": "c3_0873", "text": "‘Well I dare touch it, I’ll pick one up and hold it. I dare do anything’", "voice": "Thomas_loud_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0874.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0874", "text": "‘You’d better not.’", "voice": "Charles_neutral_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0875.wav", "who": "Thomas", "emo": "警惕", "id": "c3_0875", "text": "‘Why?’ Hooper was peering curiously into his face. ‘Why?’", "voice": "Thomas_wary_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0876.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0876", "text": "‘You might damage it. If they’re valuable you’ll get into trouble, won't you?’", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0921.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0921", "text": "‘I’m all right,’ he said.", "voice": "Charles_neutral_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0922.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0922", "text": "‘It’s O.K. I just got locked in. Goodnight,’ and raced for the stairs, before the questions could begin.", "voice": "Charles_nervous_2", "voice_was": "Charles_soft_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0942.wav", "who": "Helena", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c3_0942", "text": "‘How brave!’ somebody else’s mother had said.", "voice": "Helena_excited_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0943.wav", "who": "Helena", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0943", "text": "‘Oh, but they do not always show everything, he is bottling it up. He is only seven, and that is no age, no age at all.’", "voice": "Helena_nervous_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0944.wav", "who": "Helena", "emo": "紧张", "id": "c3_0944", "text": "Mrs Helena Kingshaw said, ‘Charles is a very sensible little boy. Though – oh, yes, I wonder so often if we are doing the right thing, if he is not still too young...’", "voice": "Helena_nervous_1"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0953.wav", "who": "Charles", "emo": "兴奋", "id": "c3_0953", "text": "He wrote home, ‘I like it here very much, it is smashing here.’", "voice": "Charles_excited_4"}
{"path": "G:/_setup/_audio_ch123/out_paused/c3_0954.wav", "who": "Helena", "emo": "委屈", "id": "c3_0954", "text": "‘He is a brave little boy,’ Mrs Helena Kingshaw had said, reading the letter, and weeping a little.", "voice": "Helena_wronged_1"}
